  "details": "## Description\n\nplacing a sticker or emoji with transparency shows a solid background. Seems to only affect Unity 6 version of beta, as i asked a friend on the Unity 2022 beta that says everything looks normal on their end.\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n\nPlace a sticker or emoji that has a transparent background.\n\n## Details\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1879-ecdbfcd219-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-07-28_22-37-39.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_e764872d-9cc4-414f-a86d-53679fbe084b/1/file)",
